      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Rineloricaria catamarcensis (Berg, 1895)</li><li>Type locality: Arroyo El Tala, Catamarca Province, Argentina</li><li>Synonym: Loricaria catamarcensis</li><li>IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2020)</li></ul>"
    },
