      "key": "notes",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1485",
      "html": "<p>Etymology: Greek, rhinos = nose + Latin, lorica, loricare = cuirass of corslet of leather. Named for Catamarca Province, Argentina, its type locality.</p><p>Pronunciation: rhine lor ee kar ee ah.</p>"
